   Could someone please post the charter for this group?  The only
traffic here for the last couple of months has been completely
inappropriate.

   This group is for discussion of problems with source code posted to
comp.sources.games.  IF YOUR ARTICLE DOES NOT REFER TO SOMETHING POSTED
TO COMP.SOURCES.GAMES, IT DOES NOT BELONG IN COMP.SOURCES.GAMES.BUGS.

   Bug reports on store-bought games do not belong here.  Take them to
comp.sys.ibm.pc.games or another appropriate group; or, better yet, call
technical support for the company from which you bought the game.

   Thank you.

